6662\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: The Voice of Hind Rajab\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"January 29, 2024. Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A 6-year old girl is trapped in a car under fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. While trying to keep her on the line, they do everything they can to get an ambulance to her. Her name was Hind Rajab.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A 6-year old girl is trapped in a car under IDF fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. Her name was Hind Rajab.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, strong threat, images of real dead bodies\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":89,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001301\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012772\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012773\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012774\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006662\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008221\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006677\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award\u00ae winning writer/director Chlo\u00e9 Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare\u2019s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award\u00ae winning writer/director Chlo\u00e9 Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare\u2019s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9Tv9wGPxIw\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000175\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001040\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001087\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004702\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004703\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007765\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c566d7dc-50bb-4d55-984b-c4c65751933e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006677\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008241\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006687\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The History of Sound\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In 1917, Lionel \u2014 a young, talented music student \u2014 meets David at the Boston Conservatory, where they bond over a deep love of folk music. Years later, Lionel receives a letter from David, leading to an impromptu journey through the backwoods of Maine to collect traditional songs. This unexpected reunion, ensuing love affair, and the music they collect and preserve, will shape the course of Lionel\u2019s life far beyond his own awareness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two young men during World War I set out to record the lives, voices and music of their American countrymen.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":\"https:/